 "text": "Actress Hedy Lammar and composer George Antheil, patented an anti -jamming idea. A torpedo steered on one fixed radio frequency could be blocked. Their fix, matching piano -style roles made sender and receiver hop frequencies together. The Navy rejected it, but frequency hopping later became common in wireless systems. Take away, a tool from one field can solve a problem in another. Download RM to support livelihood tools."
